※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 5005 LANG_STMT_VALUE_DISCARDED

※ The last statement of a body is the body's result -- but a body that answers
※ with nothing has no result, so an expression there computes a value that goes
※ nowhere, like an expression anywhere else.  An assignment is a statement that
※ does something, and is what belongs at the end of one of these.
let counter: u8 = 3u8

@[constructor]
fn prepare():
    counter

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    counter
